WEBVTT

00:09:57.894 --> 00:10:00.108
said this is "the approach that will come to prominence."

00:10:00.108 --> 00:10:02.445
And even a movie was made around our work.

00:10:02.445 --> 00:10:03.613
[The Interrupters]

00:10:03.613 --> 00:10:06.117
However, not so fast,

00:10:06.117 --> 00:10:07.979
because a lot of people did not agree

00:10:07.979 --> 00:10:09.960
with this way of going about it.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.923
We got a lot of criticism,

00:10:11.923 --> 00:10:13.662
a lot of opposition,

00:10:13.662 --> 00:10:15.397
and a lot of opponents.

00:10:15.397 --> 00:10:18.248
In other words, what do you mean, health problem?

00:10:18.248 --> 00:10:20.834
What do you mean, epidemic?

00:10:20.834 --> 00:10:23.642
What do you mean, no bad guys?

00:10:23.642 --> 00:10:25.795
And there's whole industries designed

00:10:25.795 --> 00:10:28.753
for managing bad people.

00:10:28.753 --> 00:10:31.796
What do you mean, hiring people